DEFINE
[a guard named henry
 a guard named mara
 a device named brass bell
 a key named brass key
 a table named oak table].

START
[henry is calm
 mara is calm
 brass key is on oak table
 henry has 10 health].

IF
[henry has 3 damage
 <then> (change henry to angry].

WHEN
[player attacks henry
 <then> (damage henry by 3
 <then> (cause henry attacks player].

WHEN
[henry attacks player
 <then> (damage player
 <then> (carry brass key].
